sequenceDiagram
    participant A015 as 015 User
    participant A025 as 025 Client
    participant A035 as 035 Timer
    participant A045 as 045 mserve
    participant A055 as 055 CSV File
    participant A065 as 065 Servant: Symbol Set 1 (Old)
    participant A066 as 066 Servant: Symbol Set 1 (New)
    participant A075 as 075 Servant: Symbol Set 2
    participant A085 as 085 Servant: Symbol Set 3
    participant A095 as 095 Servant: Other Symbols

    A015 ->> A045: 020 🛠 setRule (initiate canary rollout)
    A045 ->> A045: 030 🧠 Backup routing table
    A045 ->> A045: 040 🧠 Set globals: server type, % increment, interval

    A025 ->> A045: 050 📤 Send request
    A045 ->> A045: 060 🧠 Apply canaryFilter (select new version)
    A045 ->> A066: 070 📤 Dispatch to new servant (canary)
    A066 ->> A045: 080 📥 Return response (with error)

    A045 ->> A045: 090 🧠 Run filterResponse (detect error in canary)
    A045 ->> A045: 100 🧠 Error count reaches cn_maxerr (1)

    A045 ->> A045: 110 🛠 Restore routing table from backup
    A045 ->> A045: 120 🛠 Reset canary state: clear globals and backup

    A045 ->> A025: 130 📥 Return error response to client

